@startuml
title Use case: sample-gcp actors and goals

left to right direction

actor Visitor
actor Operator

rectangle "sample-gcp" {
  usecase "View demo items" as UC1
  usecase "Initialize demo data\n(first request only)" as UC2
  usecase "View build version" as UC3
  usecase "Deploy infrastructure" as UC4
  usecase "Provision GCP resources\n(main.tf)" as UC5
  usecase "Publish app\n(public/)" as UC6

  Visitor --> UC1
  Visitor --> UC3
  UC1 .> UC2 : <<include>>

  Operator --> UC4
  UC4 .> UC5 : <<include>>
  UC4 .> UC6 : <<include>>
}

note bottom of UC1
  public/app.js: loadItems() queries
  demoItems in Firestore on page load.
end note

note bottom of UC4
  README "Deploy": gcloud auth application-default login
  && npx firebase login && bash deploy.sh
end note

@enduml
